{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "39382659f5dc3e4b64cfdbe571e4355f3019a69094333d026276ab5a7ab9cbc4", "ja": "好調の裏で", "zh": "顺调的背后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e77cd692eb771b86239a7f90c719e5776d1526f2b0f7fc4a2c88566aa6ea9e28", "ja": "本読みの休憩中、監督から演技について様々\nなアドバイスをもらうアイドル達。麗花も\n感想を尋ね演技を褒められるが、本人は腑に\n落ちていない様子。そんな中、星梨花と翼の\n本読みが始まる。", "zh": "剧本围读休息期间，偶像们从导演那里得到了各种\n关于演技的建议。丽花也询问了感想，虽然得到了\n对演技的称赞，但她本人似乎并不怎么信服。就在\n这时，星梨花和翼开始了剧本围读。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "73a77677893093dd9ab318be4efc7aead762a6480d518cf8aa37b0a298d24340", "ja": "（メディア取材が入っているという事もあり、本読みは\nほぼ止まる事なく進行している。いいペースだ……）", "zh": "（因为还有媒体采访，剧本围读几乎没有停顿地进行着。进展得很顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1001_jokantoku", "source_sha256": "8e66df115f1a7ccab14e33f6f2de0406abc781ea54ab2c15a8d7347d8a00e6b3", "ja": "みなさん、お疲れ様です。区切りがいいので、\nここでいったん休憩です！　15分後に再開します！", "zh": "大家辛苦了。正好告一段落，\n现在先休息一下吧！15分钟后重新开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1002_kantoku", "source_sha256": "026eaa7e055c3a301c866c7d0bd975700eaab3e130f9271ab04fa9ca0e04562c", "ja": "お疲れ様です。みなさん、イメージを作ってきて\nくださってありがとうございます。いい感じですよ！", "zh": "辛苦了。感谢大家都构思出了形象。感觉很不错哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1003_kantoku", "source_sha256": "6f88a93eded6e4bd1d83fb24c5f2b31ce1285c1303916167a98dece47df1023b", "ja": "個別に、少しリクエストがあるので、\nここで共有させてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "我这边有一些单独的请求，可以在这里分享一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "22c24bd8d902750f410470b35a5ec3e84bbf81437b1ef1c5387af8741d8185f1", "ja": "もちろんです！　よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "当然可以！请多指教♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1005_kantoku", "source_sha256": "6c0574b8318cf58fc0d355c409ae2b27236f27b168ae1a31c7f3669c61f7f82c", "ja": "それじゃあまずはロコさん。カナエなんだけど……\nもうちょっと露骨にチャラくしちゃってもいいですね。", "zh": "那么首先，ROCO先生。关于加奈惠……再把她塑造得更明显地轻浮一些也可以呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1006_kantoku", "source_sha256": "455410fb578b97132ddc38166b798eef27f21b49f83861ea4ba7c9cefe557e12", "ja": "キラキラした生き方に見えるアビーに、憧れを\n抱いてる感じを出せると、よりカナエらしくなるかと。", "zh": "如果能表现出对看起来活得闪闪发光的阿比怀有憧憬的感觉，就更像加奈惠了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "2a83cd7c35f286f03143da8a416d12fff7040733f2ffdfa99d134daabbeb876e", "ja": "憧れ……わかりました！　監督のアドバイスを元に、\nカナエの演技をアップグレードさせますね！", "zh": "憧憬……我明白了！会根据导演的建议，\n把加奈惠的演技升级一下的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1008_kantoku", "source_sha256": "a632ef25835b5e42157b90fe20249ea17567483ac5d98c32c897ee0b0e022200", "ja": "次に舞浜さん。リイチの胡散臭い感じを、うまく\n表現してくれてると思いますが、まだやれるはずです。", "zh": "接下来是舞滨小姐。我觉得你很好地表现出了リイチ那种可疑的感觉，不过应该还能做得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1009_kantoku", "source_sha256": "14d4f3e64cf9ae3bbf78d5377d2733024c7826620f01c3a0304fc17031ef9581", "ja": "もっと飄々としてるところを前面に出してください。\nそして、決めるところはバシッとキメる感じで！", "zh": "请进一步突出那种洒脱自如的感觉。然后，在该帅气定格的时候，要干脆利落地展现出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ed26412e6703f3a30af89b7c6e127ae519a45efd390089dc3123c3b74350de67", "ja": "決めるところはキメる……ギャップってやつかな？\nわかりました、やってみます！", "zh": "该帅气定下来的时候就要利落定下来……这就是所谓的反差吧？\n明白了，我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "61c171353f50a3261331a0d20fd2b5c0b2ab719aa62a564b8c80a9f88ba50081", "ja": "はいはーい！　監督さん、私はどうでしたか？", "zh": "好啦好啦！导演先生，我刚才表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1012_kantoku", "source_sha256": "252c976a0ee440988f6aa422ca1175961b4a462d28ef8a15562cd389221c2667", "ja": "北上さんは、今の感じでバッチリです！　\nチトセのキャラ性をしっかり掴んでくれてますね。", "zh": "北上小姐，现在的感觉非常棒！  \n很好地抓住了千岁这个角色的个性呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "14659237285c68001757e7b410dba6472fd69902f2f75af3119d07f0fa1f7609", "ja": "おお～。スゴいじゃん、麗花！\nまだ本読み、始まったばっかりなのに。", "zh": "哦～好厉害啊，丽花！\n明明才刚开始读剧本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "d4eaa3c6946342aa9b8ac18ae0df1c4dbb645e4f7504b215104dfce306ec01d9", "ja": "レイカは、役の気持ちを掴むのが上手ですよね！\nロコも負けないようにがんばります♪", "zh": "丽花很擅长把握角色的心情呢！ROCO也会努力，不输给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "21af1c8e1c49c2697b3afa4f5f64c71db818c014679fa227daf74dcb0d00b302", "ja": "そっか～、そうなんですね。\n今の感じでいいんだ……。", "zh": "这样啊～原来是这么回事。\n照现在这种感觉就可以了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "db8682f85a280208cf012dbe12c06983d252a15eb1afc89c5d38dca48fe783b0", "ja": "（……？　麗花、腑に落ちてない感じだな。\n何か気になる事でもあるのかな）", "zh": "（……？丽花一副没想通的样子啊。是有什么在意的事吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1017_jokantoku", "source_sha256": "db90a7dd5d16ac67ce5b83ce418829316daa7f22f4b069251b16eaa8d8e2a0d3", "ja": "監督、すみませーん！", "zh": "导演，不好意思——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1018_kantoku", "source_sha256": "a7752bdc82cc8bf6ba4b208d486a7ea97496d0da9e32f45f0c0076dfdb0770bf", "ja": "あっ、はい！\nすみません、それじゃまた後で！", "zh": "啊，好的！\n不好意思，那待会儿再见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7210085cc84d743188df85f6d9346c7c49bdb4e9fa9379174ae9a8387f6f6338", "ja": "監督、行っちゃった。次のシーンはわたしと\n星梨花ちゃんだから、アドバイスほしかったのに～。", "zh": "导演，走掉了。下一场戏是和星梨花一起的，本来还想听听他的建议呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "c6c9f03507fe2f8e54c03cf41e61b6aa63912c015dbf4a7b493efffaaa1057bd", "ja": "そうですね……。わたしも、あまり自信がないので、\nいろいろ聞きたかったんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊……我也不太有自信，本来想多听听各种建议的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "85599658f461f8ca3de06faaee71fda04b9ea5f4878227c061186bc5ba85aa3b", "ja": "ま、でもしょうがないか！\n質問は後にして、わたしたちも休憩しよ！", "zh": "不过，也没办法啦！\n先把问题放到后面，我们也休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "546389198a9bd5a12b92a410ce8eac63d9898b5b14f220b388d1b87e73c4380e", "ja": "は、はい！\n……。", "zh": "好、好的！\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3ec56fc996df8ff782f6c7bb944e748ff7c302a1471f04baf3951e532a6aacdf", "ja": "麗花、何か納得いかない事でもあるのか？\n監督は、麗花の演技を褒めていたけど……。", "zh": "丽花，是有什么让你无法释怀的事吗？导演可是夸奖了你的演技……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "08094abf992bc58ec8d76bae7c0cda7767f830810b30f7ce354be90fd1b6fd5b", "ja": "あ、わかっちゃいました？\n納得いかないのとは、すこし違うんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，被你发现了？\n虽然和觉得不服气有点不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "4cece83d00778f121a9ef50a71fc36cd7b2b91c96e794740a097ea2e62a6eb86", "ja": "私、どうやったら友達になれるのか、\nまだわからないんです。それで、どうしようかなって。", "zh": "我还不知道该怎么做才能成为朋友……所以就在想该怎么办。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "92fdf526cff181f50a47444e173fb65976a9cb904665f9895ef55ba2bd87bd22", "ja": "友達に……？\nああ、リイチとカナエとってことか？", "zh": "朋友……？\n啊，你是说和理一、佳苗成为朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "541c9dd875ef75d99fb8667be670c2c9dcc713b95a5bd99fc4aef7295c36c583", "ja": "えっと……。", "zh": "我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1029_jokantoku", "source_sha256": "9666a449ec02c4928a3e51e6c6c704cf51703ceccbb58a1c748843b63a9ad48e", "ja": "お待たせしました。みなさん戻られたみたいなので、\nそろそろ本読み再開しまーす！", "zh": "让大家久等了。大家好像都回来了，那我们差不多要继续围读剧本啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "1825a3f8fe4f1007a257f257613cbbda7414ab72c16af5232e81edc03ad1da1f", "ja": "あっ、はーい！\nそれじゃあ{$P$}さん、また後で♪", "zh": "啊，好——！\n那么{$P$}先生，待会儿见♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "11d88a55d21973af02aacd13927f3b8d29617dc537bc3803ed9a17e8fd83d032", "ja": "ああ、わかった！\n……。", "zh": "啊，知道了！\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5121303e403e3b3a7db9b2fa2693ebe8b996f13981d6cd102b1cc6a7b703895c", "ja": "第二ゲームまで終了、現段階で生き残っている\nプレイヤーは168名。ギリ半分、ってトコかな？", "zh": "第二场游戏结束，目前存活的玩家有168名。勉强算一半吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "95ba8fa840b96bd9ab78ff1952f4eaac128b487576df547f19e095129ab24da6", "ja": "ふっ……そうでなくては面白くない。\nここからが、本当の勝負だ。", "zh": "哼……这样才有意思。\n真正的较量，现在才开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b17c7a75745feca3d7894d83ce53bb381589463b8a43cb6f91c237faabb1dd4", "ja": "とはいえ、あと3回予定ですよ？　この段階で\nもうちょっと削れてないと、少し多いかなって。", "zh": "不过，接下来还计划进行3次吧？到了这个阶段，要是还没再削减一点，我觉得就有点多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "5b80aec71a4d01516c34fca90cf4a6d7713ed8f7d8f968faaa082c673446b2ea", "ja": "そうだな……第三のゲーム以降の内容を少し弄らせて\nもらおうか。彼らには、より絶望を味わってもらう。", "zh": "是啊……那就让我稍微改动一下第三场游戏之后的内容吧。让他们品尝更多的绝望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5a76ff9c88217bac4d40d19254fd28599ea8d87344e1f49cfe0dbf86ec83d49a", "ja": "鞠音様が言うなら、いいですけど……\n超絶無理ゲー押し付けるとか、やめてくださいよ～？", "zh": "既然鞠音大人都这么说了，那就没问题……不过，请别硬塞给他们超绝无理的游戏啦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d4c40000173682401329e39592a03c1c7a0a2a22623aecc94d0bb47a93f2d46a", "ja": "そんなつまんない画じゃ、撮れ高ないし！\n『あび＠ちゃんねる』で、そんなの流せると思います？", "zh": "这种无聊的画面，根本没有可用素材！你觉得『あび＠频道』能播这种东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "e772e415b5bea52efeb7ce0a9fff7e05156dc22be2406cca7398828a647cf251", "ja": "しかし、ただ一方的に\n蹂躙するだけでは面白くない……そうだろう？", "zh": "不过，只是一味单方面碾压，也没什么意思……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c826a71bbb9bef00d352cbe3dc76f1c72aa10173a246a02a0b3db0f49143cce4", "ja": "逆転、反撃、どんでん返し……さっすが大富豪の\n鞠音様！　視聴者が欲しがるツボを理解してますね～！", "zh": "逆转、反击、峰回路转……不愧是大富豪鞠音大人！完全理解观众想看的爽点呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "dd514c7e687efd053c9e8e1cd8886ab623f24a8daff259fa01748c2ee8c926cd", "ja": "ギリギリのところで相手の裏をかき、\n勝利を掴み取る……それこそが勝負師としての本懐だ。", "zh": "在千钧一发之际出其不意，夺取胜利……这才是赌徒的本色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "48148eea7ca74d3242dbc9cdd1fd7060e18bdba307ad5833a3980502b89dec93", "ja": "こちらもゲームマスターとして、\n必ず劇的な勝利をしてみせるまでだ。フフッ。", "zh": "我也会以游戏主持人的身份，定要赢得一场戏剧性的胜利。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1042_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e0a939990e4f94f8aa644ba4465338f6fe9aa0f51cffe47bb87f758464d26522", "ja": "鞠音様の立ち回り、私も視聴者の\nひとりとして、楽しみにさせてもらいますね♪", "zh": "鞠音大人的表现，我也会作为观众之一，拭目以待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_03_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1bd020752d17b734a7827f2f7487b8e1ae46856b437892b59d8e71ce04bfb807", "ja": "もちろん運営としても、ゲームが盛り上がるよう、\n引き続きサポートしますからね☆", "zh": "作为运营方，为了让游戏更加热闹，\n我当然也会继续做好支持工作的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
